    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Histological prognostic factors in oral cavity and tongue cancer&nbsp;&ndash; an overview of data derived from meta-analyses, depicted as hazard ratio (HR) or odds ratio (OR) for overall survival or for disease-specific survival (DSS)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Mark W. Lingen",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 697.4pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Risk factor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>HR or OR (95%&nbsp;CI)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 267.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Remarks</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Reference</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>DOI</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">OR: 0.49 (0.10&ndash;2.34)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 267.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DOI &gt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm compared with DOI &lt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{31520552}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Tumour budding</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HR: 1.88 (1.25&ndash;2.82)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 267.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Compared with no budding</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29190636}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Perineural invasion</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HR: 2.01 (1.10&ndash;3.7)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 267.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Compared with no invasion</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28359633}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Lymphovascular invasion</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"263\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HR: 1.55 (1.43&ndash;1.69)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 267.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"356\">\r